{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>想在家中感受胎兒心跳，Snuggly 讓準父母只憑 iPhone 就能聆聽、錄音並分享懷孕期間的胎心聲，無需額外配件或裝置，適合希望與寶寶建立更緊密連結的家庭。程式原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-105.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>手機貼腹即可收音錄音</h2>\n<p>Snuggly 以 iPhone 麥克風貼近下腹收音，配合演算法隔離並放大胎心聲音，在安靜房間慢慢移動找到位置後即可錄音，並分享給伴侶與親友。程式僅 18 MB，無需額外配件。官方建議懷孕第 22 週起使用較穩定，佩戴耳機、平躺放鬆有助聽清細微聲響；本程式屬身心健康與連結用途，並非醫療裝置，不可用作診斷。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-348-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-349-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-350-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-351-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-352-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-353-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Snuggly: Record Baby Heartbeat</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/snuggly-record-baby-heartbeat/id1663946323?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:13.254549+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:25:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:12:31.809791+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:39.620548+00:00","content_hash":"134fa969a6196ccf4e328849741d533f09f8aaaa7281b1fe4a6a2cb5188a87de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}